{"resource": {"name": "Combined Community Survey Raw Results", "id": "x5d3-4cfd", "resource_name": null, "parent_fxf": [], "description": "The data is the combined raw data of the Community Survey results from 2012 to 2018.  Important to note the 2012 survey is missing questions regarding the Tivoli and Memorial Auditorium as these questions were added in the 2013 survey and continue to persist.", "attribution": null, "attribution_link": null, "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2019-01-23T15:43:17.000Z", "createdAt": "2019-01-23T15:30:12.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2019-01-23T15:43:17.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2019-01-23T15:43:16.000Z", "columns_name": ["16a Has a new commercial development been completed in or near your neighborhood in the last 12 months? (Yes)", "Year (Date)", "Format", "1a Overall, how do you rate the quality of life in Chattanooga as a place to live. (Very Good & Good)", "1c Overall, how do you rate the quality of life in Chattanooga as a place to work.  (Very Good & Good)", "2b How safe would you feel walking alone during the day in the park closest to you? (Very Safe & Safe)", "11b How do you rate the quality of the parks near your home for well-maintained facilities? (Very Good & Good)", "12 In the past 12 months, did anyone in your household participate in a Chattanooga Parks and Recreation activity? (Yes)", "15a How do you rate City streets on smoothness? (Very Good & Good)", "15c How do you rate City streets on speeding vehicles? (Very Good & Good)", "15dvHow do you rate City streets on safety of pedestrians? (Very Good & Good)", "15e How do you rate City streets on safety of bicyclists? (Very Good & Good)", "Sex", "Age", "Length of Stay in Chattanooga", "Own or Rent", "Year", "18e How do you rate your neighborhood on access to shopping and other services? (Very Good & Good)", "18f How do you rate your neighborhood on on-street parking? (Very Good & Good)", "19a How do you rate Chattanooga as a place to do business